          "title": "Flower Garden",
          "subtitle": "Patience",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Flower Garden, also known as The Bouquet or The Garden, is an old one-deck Fan-family patience with a reserve garden and foundations."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Flower Garden is an old patience first called Le Parterre and associated with a Japanese predecessor. It uses one standard deck and belongs to the Fan family of open-layout solitaires."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
